{"id":"76ff911ecd7b22c8","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-tempered-distribution.md","title":"Tempered Distribution","display":"df-tempered-distribution — Tempered Distribution","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-tempered-distribution","aliases":["58-df-tempered-distribution","58-df-zfc-ana-tempered-distribution"],"display":"df-tempered-distribution — Tempered Distribution","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-schwartz-space.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-complex-schwartz-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-tempered-distribution"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-tempered-distribution</span><span>58-df-zfc-ana-tempered-distribution</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tempered-distribution — Tempered Distribution"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fbec6c5b7a044255\" href=\"?note=fbec6c5b7a044255\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-schwartz-space.md\">../batch06/58-df-schwartz-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a6c5654857edae16\" href=\"?note=a6c5654857edae16\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-complex-schwartz-data.md\">../batch06/58-df-complex-schwartz-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\">\\(n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\)</span>；本文件的测试空间明确为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{\\mathbb C}(\\mathbb R^n)\">\\(\\mathcal S_{\\mathbb C}(\\mathbb R^n)\\)</span>，取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a6c5654857edae16\" href=\"?note=a6c5654857edae16\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-complex-schwartz-data.md\">../batch06/58-df-complex-schwartz-data.md</a> 的复化空间。原有 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fbec6c5b7a044255\" href=\"?note=fbec6c5b7a044255\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-schwartz-space.md\">../batch06/58-df-schwartz-space.md</a> 中的实值空间不变。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathcal S_{\\mathbb C}(\\mathbb R^n)}\">\\(T\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathcal S_{\\mathbb C}(\\mathbb R^n)}\\)</span>；复标量线性组合、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x^\\alpha\">\\(x^\\alpha\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\partial^\\beta\\varphi\">\\(\\partial^\\beta\\varphi\\)</span> 按上述依赖中的函数图解释。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAnaTemperedDistribution}_S(T,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAnaTemperedDistribution}_S(T,n)\\)</span> 为二参数关系，定义复线性连续泛函。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sum_{|\\alpha|,|\\beta|\\le N}\">\\(\\sum_{|\\alpha|,|\\beta|\\le N}\\)</span> 的指标集为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle\\in(\\omega^n)\\times(\\omega^n):|\\alpha|\\le N\\land|\\beta|\\le N\\}\">\\(\\{\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle\\in(\\omega^n)\\times(\\omega^n):|\\alpha|\\le N\\land|\\beta|\\le N\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tempered\\text{-}distribution} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcAnaTemperedDistribution}_S(T,n)\\leftrightarrow\\left(n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land T:\\mathcal S_{\\mathbb C}(\\mathbb R^n)\\to\\mathbb C\\land\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathcal S_{\\mathbb C}(\\mathbb R^n)\\;(T(a\\varphi+b\\psi)=aT(\\varphi)+bT(\\psi))\\land\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathcal S_{\\mathbb C}(\\mathbb R^n)\\;\\left(|T(\\varphi)|\\leq C\\sum_{|\\alpha|,|\\beta|\\leq N}\\sup_{x\\in\\mathbb R^n}|x^\\alpha\\partial^\\beta\\varphi(x)|\\right)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tempered\\text{-}distribution} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcAnaTemperedDistribution}_S(T,n)\\leftrightarrow\\left(n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land T:\\mathcal S_{\\mathbb C}(\\mathbb R^n)\\to\\mathbb C\\land\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathcal S_{\\mathbb C}(\\mathbb R^n)\\;(T(a\\varphi+b\\psi)=aT(\\varphi)+bT(\\psi))\\land\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathcal S_{\\mathbb C}(\\mathbb R^n)\\;\\left(|T(\\varphi)|\\leq C\\sum_{|\\alpha|,|\\beta|\\leq N}\\sup_{x\\in\\mathbb R^n}|x^\\alpha\\partial^\\beta\\varphi(x)|\\right)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Tempered distributions grow at most polynomially.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{S}&#39;\">\\(\\mathcal{S}&#39;\\)</span> includes <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^p\">\\(L^p\\)</span>, polynomials, Dirac delta.</li>\n<li>Fourier transform extends: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}: \\mathcal{S}&#39; \\to \\mathcal{S}&#39;\">\\(\\mathcal{F}: \\mathcal{S}&#39; \\to \\mathcal{S}&#39;\\)</span> continuously.</li>\n<li>Sobolev spaces <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H^s\">\\(H^s\\)</span> are subspaces of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{S}&#39;\">\\(\\mathcal{S}&#39;\\)</span> via Fourier multiplier.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-schwartz-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"fbec6c5b7a044255","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-schwartz-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-complex-schwartz-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"a6c5654857edae16","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-compl